Title: The Lone Typist
Credit: Written by
Author: A. Writer
Draft date: October 28, 2026
Contact:
    1 Basement Office
    Washington, D.C.

FADE IN:

INT. FBI BASEMENT OFFICE - NIGHT

A single desk lamp. Files stacked to the ceiling. A poster on the wall has been *torn down* and taped back up.

AGENT REYES (40s), sleeves rolled, feeds a sheet into an old IBM Selectric.

REYES
(not looking up)
You're late. The tape's already rolling.

COLE (O.S.)
The tape's been rolling since _nineteen seventy-three_.

Cole steps into the light, holding a manila envelope like it might bite.

REYES
Then we're **both** late.

CUT TO:

EXT. PARKING GARAGE - CONTINUOUS

Concrete. Fluorescent hum. A cigarette glows in the dark and goes out.
